Fixtures produced by the real toolchain, not by this package.

testkey.pub / testkey.sec
    A throwaway keypair, generated for these tests and used nowhere else.
    Passphrase: hunter2, which is also in the test source.

    This secret key is published deliberately: exercising sign, key
    decryption and wrong-passphrase handling needs one. It signs nothing
    real, and must never be used for anything.

other.pub
    An unrelated public key, for key-mismatch cases.

plakar-dist.pub
    The live PlakarKorp package-signing public key. Public keys are meant
    to be published; this one verifies the fixtures below.

recipe.yaml, recipe.yaml.sum, recipe.yaml.sum.sig
    Fetched from plakar.io/dist. Signed by plakar-dist.pub, embedded.
    These fail if this package stops agreeing with signify(1) itself.
